        "en": "Original PDF opening and abstract checked; historical original PME is distinguished from the implemented B-spline variant."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "essmann1995",
      "author": "U. Essmann, L. Perera, M. L. Berkowitz, T. Darden, H. Lee and L. G. Pedersen",
      "year": 1995,
      "title": "A smooth particle mesh Ewald method",
      "doi": "10.1063/1.470117",
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1063/1.470117",
      "review_level": "selected-full-text",
      "review_note": {
        "ja": "原著PDFのBスプライン構造因子・FFT・解析勾配に関わる部分と抄録を確認。全ベンチマークの再現ではありません。",
        "en": "Original PDF abstract and selected spline/structure-factor, FFT and analytic-gradient material checked; not a reproduction of every paper benchmark."
      }
    }
  ],
